  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Improved generation for TargetFramework=net9. 2025-02-07\n- feat: Added some default JsonSerializerContextTypes. 2025-01-07\n- feat: Added Cohere AllOf inheritance/polymorphism support. 2024-12-18\n- feat: Added x-enum-descriptions support. 2024-12-07\n- feat: Added authorization methods to client interfaces. 2024-11-27\n- feat: Now HttpClient will try to use HTTP/3.0 or HTTP/2.0 if available 2024-11-27\n- feat: Added additional format support like decimal/char/short/byte. 2024-11-27\n- feat: Updated to net9. 2024-11-13\n- feat: Replaced AnyOf JsonConverterFactory with explicit generic converters. 2024-11-13\n- feat(cli): Use net9 in sln template. 2024-11-13\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Fixed OpenAI usage in CLI. 2025-02-07\n- fix: Added GenerateEndPointAttributes to reduce code duplication and fix issues. 2025-01-07\n- fix: Fixed Experimental attribute namespace. 2025-01-07\n- fix: Fixed issues with AllOf polymorphism. 2024-12-22\n- fix: Fixed serialization issue for some enums. 2024-12-09\n- fix: Fixed bug with pattern status codes like 4XX. 2024-12-09\n- fix: Fixed issue with OpenAI spec. 2024-12-05\n- test: Renamed files to fix Snapshot tests. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Fixed CLI. 2024-12-03\n- fix: Fixed Discriminator property name for some cases. 2024-12-03",
